  "body": "https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/14464 added `icu` as a new, optional native dependency to improve user directory search for non-English languages. If the python module is installed, then the new user search code is used, otherwise it will fall back to the old code.\r\n\r\nWe should:\r\n\r\n1. Update our installation instructions for native dependencies to include `icu` / `libicu-dev`.\r\n2. Update the UPGRADE notes to mention the new dependency. (This is the release blocker)\r\n3. Update the [Contributing Guide](https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/development/contributing_guide.html) to mention installing `icu` / `libicu-dev`, otherwise `poetry install --extras all` will fail to install `pyicu`.",
